WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:46.784
Come on. Come on!


00:00:47.577 --> 00:00:51.747
Come on. Move it, let's go!
Let's go. Men. Quick!


00:01:43.298 --> 00:01:44.858
ACTIVITY...


00:01:44.882 --> 00:01:46.026
Can you see anything?


00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.319
ACTIVITY NOT DETECTED


00:01:47.343 --> 00:01:48.552
Not a thing.


00:01:50.638 --> 00:01:52.139
What is the alert for?


00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:56.351
We'll find out...


00:01:56.602 --> 00:02:00.898
Channel 1 is common. Channel 2
is for officers. Channel 3 is for Command.


00:02:01.108 --> 00:02:02.584
Report to the common channel.


00:02:02.608 --> 00:02:03.627
Roger that.


00:02:03.651 --> 00:02:07.738
You have multiple hostiles
3 km away and closing.


00:02:07.989 --> 00:02:08.989
Details?


00:02:09.157 --> 00:02:13.285
They have a heat signature,
and they're moving at 20 km/h.


00:02:13.745 --> 00:02:15.829
They're much bigger than a person.


00:02:16.039 --> 00:02:17.539
What the hell are they?


00:02:17.749 --> 00:02:21.376
They're the enemy, soldier.
What do you do with the enemy?


00:02:21.836 --> 00:02:23.170
I kill them. Major.


00:02:23.379 --> 00:02:24.421
Exactly.


00:02:24.714 --> 00:02:26.089
So get ready.


00:02:26.466 --> 00:02:27.716
Yes. Sir.


00:03:08.089 --> 00:03:10.215
So what do you really do for a living?


00:03:10.591 --> 00:03:11.800
I told you.


00:03:12.551 --> 00:03:13.635
Oh. Come on.


00:03:15.262 --> 00:03:16.346
Seriously.


00:03:16.847 --> 00:03:17.889
OK.


00:03:19.058 --> 00:03:21.559
- You voluntarily enlisted?
- I am.


00:03:21.811 --> 00:03:25.480
Come on. Our military has gotten better,
but not that much better.


00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.650
Also. What are you doing in Moscow then?


00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:31.403
You're hanging out, picking up girls.


00:03:33.072 --> 00:03:35.948
I'm on leave for two weeks,
I've been in for a year.


00:03:37.992 --> 00:03:39.076
And?


00:03:40.662 --> 00:03:42.746
Don't be confused by the fancy restaurant.


00:03:43.331 --> 00:03:45.833
I can afford it, my family is rich...


00:03:46.751 --> 00:03:48.669
My father has his own plant
in Samara.


00:03:49.087 --> 00:03:52.840
He served for 15 years,
then started his own business.


00:03:53.091 --> 00:03:56.009
Also. My brother was special forces.
He was in Syria.


00:03:56.428 --> 00:03:59.596
So. You decided to honor
the family legacy.


00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:02.141
Well. You could say that.


00:04:03.351 --> 00:04:04.810
Where did you serve?


00:04:05.352 --> 00:04:08.020
The 45th Special Forces Airborne Brigade.


00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.106
Oh? Airborne?


00:04:11.024 --> 00:04:12.525
So. Did you go parachuting?


00:04:12.734 --> 00:04:14.068
Of course. It's airborne.


00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.489
Tough guy, huh?


00:04:55.903 --> 00:04:56.903
Cool!


00:05:28.267 --> 00:05:30.268
Ladies and gentlemen,
our airplane is descending


00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:33.063
We'll arrive to the airport in 18 minutes


00:05:34.107 --> 00:05:36.460
Please return to your seats
and get ready for landing


00:05:36.484 --> 00:05:38.252
Put your seat back in the upright position


00:05:38.276 --> 00:05:40.129
fold up your meal tray,
open your window blind


00:05:40.153 --> 00:05:43.531
lower the armrests of your seat
and fasten your seatbelt


00:06:32.121 --> 00:06:33.246
What is that?


00:06:34.498 --> 00:06:36.916
I don't know,
but I think it's something serious.


00:06:37.668 --> 00:06:41.128
We interrupt your regularly
scheduled TV program


00:06:41.379 --> 00:06:44.381
to bring you this
emergency bulletin.


00:06:44.882 --> 00:06:49.970
We've lost contact with the majority
of Russia's most populated areas.


00:06:50.514 --> 00:06:55.184
So far, EMERCOM centers haven't reported
any natural disasters.


00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.313
God, Oleg. She's so scared.


00:06:58.522 --> 00:06:59.814
...for nuclear attacks...


00:07:00.065 --> 00:07:03.169
- Did they say "nuclear attacks"?
- Maybe it's a war?


00:07:03.193 --> 00:07:04.588
What?


00:07:04.612 --> 00:07:07.655
...are today's events just
a series of accidents


00:07:08.282 --> 00:07:10.616
or is this the result of an attack?


00:07:11.826 --> 00:07:13.785
Some experts assume


00:07:14.037 --> 00:07:17.205
that terrorists may be responsible
for these events.


00:07:17.415 --> 00:07:20.876
Government authorities ask you
to remain calm.


00:07:21.169 --> 00:07:22.294
I'm calling my father...


00:07:22.503 --> 00:07:24.546
...Do not give in to provocations.


00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.882
We've just...


00:07:28.176 --> 00:07:30.218
received a message...


00:07:31.429 --> 00:07:36.016
It's not just Russian cities,


00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.061
we've lost
contact with the rest of the world.


00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:44.690
There's no response from phones.
Telegraphs, radios, or Internet sites.


00:07:45.651 --> 00:07:48.027
Stay tuned, we're trying to learn more.


00:07:54.451 --> 00:07:58.537
Base. This is Bro-1. ETA 4 minutes.


00:07:59.998 --> 00:08:02.500
This is a quick recon mission.


00:08:02.834 --> 00:08:07.463
Our target is a large town
that we recently lost contact with.


00:08:07.964 --> 00:08:11.299
We've sent drones there.
None of them have returned.


00:08:11.801 --> 00:08:12.884
Kolya!


00:08:13.427 --> 00:08:16.513
The first thing you do
is check radiation levels.


00:08:16.972 --> 00:08:18.223
Yes. Sir.


00:08:19.225 --> 00:08:20.392
Alright. Press!


00:08:26.899 --> 00:08:28.149
Miss?


00:08:28.693 --> 00:08:31.861
Don't go anywhere,
always remain behind the soldiers.


00:08:32.071 --> 00:08:34.257
Try to keep your head down.


00:08:34.281 --> 00:08:36.533
Don't make any noise, don't talk.


00:08:38.035 --> 00:08:39.661
Major, we're almost there.


00:08:44.332 --> 00:08:46.375
I can't see anything, there's no light.


00:08:47.085 --> 00:08:48.836
There's a line, I see a highway.


00:08:54.926 --> 00:08:58.262
It's like it's been cut off.
It's starting. What do they call it?


00:08:58.555 --> 00:08:59.722
Quarantine.


00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.101
This entire thrust line
has been sealed off like a closed border.


00:09:04.352 --> 00:09:07.062
We're right over the town.
We're landing.


00:09:36.301 --> 00:09:39.386
Bro-1, this is Orlan-1.
Can you hear me? Over.


00:09:40.221 --> 00:09:42.680
This is Bro-1, we hear you. Over.


00:09:47.311 --> 00:09:49.289
We're moving in. Cover us.


00:09:49.313 --> 00:09:51.063
Copy that. Over and out.


00:10:56.878 --> 00:10:58.796
She's been dead for a few hours.


00:11:00.382 --> 00:11:01.882
How did they all die?


00:11:04.427 --> 00:11:05.427
Let's move out.


00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.556
Let's search that building.


00:11:11.977 --> 00:11:15.789
Bro-1. This is Orlan-1.
We'll search the building and come back.


00:11:15.813 --> 00:11:17.939
Get ready to pick us up in 30 minutes.


00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:21.067
Orlan-1, copy that. The street is clear.


00:11:48.345 --> 00:11:49.470
Look...


00:11:50.055 --> 00:11:51.639
dinner is on the table.


00:11:53.475 --> 00:11:56.936
You see, it happened suddenly,
it caught people off guard.


00:11:57.187 --> 00:12:01.626
This family was about to have dinner,
the cashier, the customers in the aisles,


00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.443
the drivers behind the wheels.


00:12:04.236 --> 00:12:05.528
Where are they then?


00:12:05.821 --> 00:12:07.030
Where's who?


00:12:07.406 --> 00:12:10.199
You said the family was about
to have dinner.


00:12:10.618 --> 00:12:11.826
Where are they?


00:12:40.146 --> 00:12:41.563
He took my rifle.


00:12:46.652 --> 00:12:48.027
Fire! Everybody, fire!


00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.087
Hold your fire!


00:13:07.047 --> 00:13:09.674
I don't get it, we had to have hit him.


00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.509
I was shooting right at him.


00:13:11.718 --> 00:13:13.094
Who was that?


00:13:13.637 --> 00:13:16.180
Who the hell knows?
It's just a silhouette.


00:13:18.099 --> 00:13:19.224
Was it human?


00:13:19.392 --> 00:13:20.475
Yes.


00:13:20.768 --> 00:13:25.355
Kolya got lucky, the vest caught
all the bullets. All his ribs are broken.


00:13:25.731 --> 00:13:28.400
We need to carry him.
The chopper is on its way.


00:13:28.901 --> 00:13:29.901
Let's bug out.


00:13:41.038 --> 00:13:43.164
Don't worry. Kolyan, it'll be alright.


00:13:43.499 --> 00:13:45.978
What matters is it didn't
get through the vest.


00:13:46.002 --> 00:13:47.002
You'll be fine.


00:13:47.544 --> 00:13:49.420
Hey! Did you see the shooter?


00:13:49.754 --> 00:13:50.796
No.


00:13:51.423 --> 00:13:52.965
He came out of nowhere.


00:13:53.675 --> 00:13:57.052
He took my rifle and blinded me
with a light. I couldn't see anything.


00:13:57.262 --> 00:13:59.513
He just started shooting.


00:14:00.306 --> 00:14:02.975
Major, I have HQ on the line.


00:14:05.603 --> 00:14:06.622
HQ. Come in.


00:14:06.646 --> 00:14:09.441
This is Major Dolmatov,
the CO of Recon Team 7.


00:14:09.817 --> 00:14:10.984
We're RTB.


00:14:11.986 --> 00:14:14.446
There were no survivors
among the civilians.


00:14:15.072 --> 00:14:19.450
We encountered an unidentified hostile
in the quarantine zone.


00:14:29.836 --> 00:14:31.230
MONTH OF THE UNKNOWN


00:14:31.254 --> 00:14:34.465
It's been almost a month
since we've lost all contact


00:14:34.632 --> 00:14:36.300
with the quarantine zone.


00:14:36.509 --> 00:14:39.553
Over 100,000,000 Russian citizens
are considered missing.


00:14:39.804 --> 00:14:41.722
This information hasn't been confirmed.


00:14:41.931 --> 00:14:45.161
Meanwhile, the authorities advise
all citizens to remain calm.


00:14:45.185 --> 00:14:48.854
There are no plans to expand
the quarantine zone at this time.


00:14:49.271 --> 00:14:52.042
However. The authorities' appeals
have been ignored


00:14:52.066 --> 00:14:53.733
by some people of faith.


00:14:54.151 --> 00:14:56.944
Thousands of Muslims have gathered
on Red Square today


00:14:57.154 --> 00:14:59.632
in anticipation of the upcoming
"end of the world."


00:14:59.656 --> 00:15:02.283
Christian Orthodox followers
gather in churches.


00:15:02.493 --> 00:15:05.161
A cross procession took place
on New Arbat today.


00:15:05.537 --> 00:15:08.058
Due to this occurrence.
The capital's authorities


00:15:08.082 --> 00:15:11.834
advise you not to give in to panic
and remain calm...


00:15:25.431 --> 00:15:27.951
ORDER TO REPORT FOR INDUCTION INTO
THE ARMED FORCES OF THE RF


00:15:27.975 --> 00:15:29.935
Yura, what are they saying?


00:15:30.812 --> 00:15:32.229
Nothing, Mom.


00:15:33.523 --> 00:15:35.816
Everything's fine, life goes on.


00:15:36.609 --> 00:15:38.110
Where's my lipstick?


00:15:42.031 --> 00:15:43.490
Help me get ready.


00:15:44.742 --> 00:15:47.077
- Where are you going?
- To the store.


00:15:47.411 --> 00:15:49.996
Dad will be home soon.
And we have no food.


00:15:54.626 --> 00:15:56.794
There's no need, Mom, I already bought it.


00:15:57.963 --> 00:15:59.463
The fridge is stocked.


00:16:07.389 --> 00:16:08.472
Take this.


00:16:09.057 --> 00:16:10.057
What's this?


00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.642
Your pills, Mom.


00:16:12.352 --> 00:16:13.496
What pills?


00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:15.396
Mom, you take these every day.


00:16:40.755 --> 00:16:41.922
Call your father.


00:16:46.344 --> 00:16:48.262
Tell him to be home on time.


00:16:49.347 --> 00:16:52.140
Mom, Dad died three years ago.


00:16:54.476 --> 00:16:57.687
I'm off to work, will be back late.
If anything, call Sveta.


00:16:58.063 --> 00:17:00.356
Sveta lives next door. Remember her?


00:17:02.985 --> 00:17:06.988
I asked him this morning,
"When will you be back?"


00:17:10.951 --> 00:17:12.994
Alright, take care.


00:17:54.618 --> 00:17:58.348
Your dreams... dreams... dreams...


00:17:58.372 --> 00:17:59.830
...is our reality...


00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:05.211
Virtual Love Chamber is waiting for you. At
your disposal there are more than 1000...


00:18:14.304 --> 00:18:15.930
Hold it, kid!


00:18:23.438 --> 00:18:24.980
Welcome...


00:18:28.484 --> 00:18:34.155
WE ARE ALREADY DEAD


00:18:45.209 --> 00:18:49.231
McLuck-8. Good morning, this is Dagger-4,
we're approaching the perimeter.


00:18:49.255 --> 00:18:50.964
Permission to land? Over.


00:18:52.008 --> 00:18:54.717
Dagger-4. Permission granted. Pad 2.


00:18:55.552 --> 00:18:57.636
Copy that. Landing.


00:18:57.804 --> 00:19:00.807
And a good morning
won't begin for another 2 hours...


00:19:50.523 --> 00:19:51.648
Attention!


00:20:00.074 --> 00:20:01.366
At ease, soldiers.


00:20:02.117 --> 00:20:04.911
Let me introduce myself.
It. Colonel Osmolovskaya.


00:20:06.246 --> 00:20:08.206
Main Intelligence Directorate.


00:20:08.874 --> 00:20:11.292
I apologize if I came at a bad time.


00:20:11.502 --> 00:20:13.127
Hope everyone put their pants on.


00:20:13.295 --> 00:20:14.504
And what if we didn't?


00:20:14.671 --> 00:20:16.756
Then you'll listen with a bare ass.


00:20:20.094 --> 00:20:23.513
As we all know. Something
happened 24 days ago.


00:20:23.931 --> 00:20:26.640
And all contact was lost
with most of the world.


00:20:26.974 --> 00:20:30.602
The entire quarantine zone
is suddenly in a total blackout.


00:20:30.812 --> 00:20:34.147
Everything outside this circle
is in complete darkness.


00:20:35.108 --> 00:20:37.359
The majority of this Circle of Life


00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:42.572
is in Russia. Most of Finland.
Estonia, Latvia,


00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.533
Belarus and Ukraine.


00:20:45.326 --> 00:20:48.703
Recon teams sent out along
the inner edge of the quarantine


00:20:48.871 --> 00:20:52.707
reported similar situations
in all the populated areas.


00:20:53.835 --> 00:20:57.920
Dead civilians and several contacts
with an unidentified hostile.


00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.881
One of the teams brought some bodies back.


00:21:01.133 --> 00:21:06.262
Autopsies showed that the COD was
poisoning with endogenous neurotoxins,


00:21:07.889 --> 00:21:10.015
as in. Chemicals produced
by the human body.


00:21:10.183 --> 00:21:13.663
Are you trying to say that all the bodies
within this "Circle of Life"


00:21:13.687 --> 00:21:15.729
just went ahead and poisoned themselves?


00:21:16.022 --> 00:21:17.440
Not me, the facts.


00:21:18.191 --> 00:21:21.629
Our primary objective
is to collect all the necessary data


00:21:21.653 --> 00:21:25.239
for the scientists, so they can determine
the nature of these events.


00:21:25.991 --> 00:21:30.453
Our secondary objective is to move deeper
into the quarantine zone.


00:21:31.663 --> 00:21:34.039
The country's resources
are extremely limited.


00:21:34.249 --> 00:21:35.958
We need to get our territory back.


00:21:36.293 --> 00:21:38.169
However. We have to be very careful,


00:21:38.462 --> 00:21:39.628
because...


00:21:41.506 --> 00:21:43.507
there is more bad news.


00:21:44.968 --> 00:21:48.053
Five recon teams that were deployed
deep into the quarantine zone


00:21:48.263 --> 00:21:49.388
are MIA.


00:21:49.639 --> 00:21:51.390
I think many of you know this.


00:21:51.641 --> 00:21:55.561
I heard from the guys
a few teams have vanished.


00:21:57.105 --> 00:22:00.709
But I doubt you heard that
an entire company of tanks was sent


00:22:00.733 --> 00:22:04.068
toward the Kirov Region on the first day.


00:22:06.113 --> 00:22:08.114
An entire company...


00:22:08.908 --> 00:22:10.658
...along with 70 tanks...


00:22:14.538 --> 00:22:15.955
All contact was lost.


00:22:20.711 --> 00:22:23.505
This outpost is situated
at the very edge.


00:22:23.964 --> 00:22:26.841
The recon teams that leave from here
do come back.


00:22:27.301 --> 00:22:30.219
Everyone who's gone deeper in
hasn't returned.


00:22:31.387 --> 00:22:33.305
We need to figure out why.


00:22:42.232 --> 00:22:44.566
EMERCOM is taking forever again.


00:22:44.901 --> 00:22:47.277
I think we got a medical supply delivery.


00:22:50.448 --> 00:22:52.199
I don't like these woods.


00:22:53.451 --> 00:22:56.453
It feels like someone
is always watching us from there.


00:22:56.955 --> 00:22:58.830
Too bad we don't have a flamethrower.


00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:03.019
Hello, soldiers!
Looks like you're good with medicine now.


00:23:03.043 --> 00:23:06.295
We brought you a doctor, too.
Where can we settle in?


00:23:11.802 --> 00:23:12.885
Alyona?


00:23:13.095 --> 00:23:14.512
Do you know her?


00:23:17.099 --> 00:23:19.183
Take cover!


00:23:37.577 --> 00:23:41.454
HQ. Channel 1 is common. Channel 2
is for officers, channel 3 is for Command.


00:23:41.664 --> 00:23:42.789
Report to channel 1.


00:23:43.165 --> 00:23:44.165
Roger that.


00:23:44.292 --> 00:23:49.045
You have multiple hostiles
3 km away and closing.


00:23:49.797 --> 00:23:50.839
Details?


00:23:51.048 --> 00:23:55.219
They have a heat signature,
and they're moving at 20 km/h.


00:23:55.596 --> 00:23:57.680
They're much bigger than a person.


00:23:59.683 --> 00:24:01.034
Attention!


00:24:01.058 --> 00:24:04.060
Strong electromagnetic radiation
has been detected.


00:24:12.111 --> 00:24:14.154
Everybody, hold your positions!


00:24:16.949 --> 00:24:18.450
Don't move!


00:24:33.423 --> 00:24:35.090
Targets are closing in.


00:24:35.383 --> 00:24:37.009
Major, they're headed toward you.


00:24:40.221 --> 00:24:41.430
500 meters.


00:24:41.681 --> 00:24:42.806
Ready!


00:24:50.273 --> 00:24:51.315
300 meters.


00:24:58.657 --> 00:24:59.657
150 meters.


00:25:10.209 --> 00:25:11.292
Fire!


00:26:06.430 --> 00:26:08.723
At 5 a.m. this morning,


00:26:09.391 --> 00:26:13.686
a military outpost
in the Kirov region was attacked.


00:26:13.979 --> 00:26:21.027
The attack wasn't carried out
by a group of people, but rather a...


00:26:21.404 --> 00:26:23.071
Men, we have another one!


00:26:23.406 --> 00:26:26.908
...it's hard to believe, but these facts
speak for themselves...


00:26:27.201 --> 00:26:28.285
Check this out!


00:26:36.209 --> 00:26:37.877
...there are casualties...


00:26:40.172 --> 00:26:41.380
Come on.


00:26:58.982 --> 00:27:00.816
And, up.


00:27:03.820 --> 00:27:05.403
How are you. Brother?


00:27:06.071 --> 00:27:07.947
I thought we'd lost you there.


00:27:45.443 --> 00:27:50.072
Damn, it's really you.
I thought I'd dreamt it when I was out.


00:27:52.033 --> 00:27:54.535
It's a small world, especially now.


00:27:58.289 --> 00:28:02.311
I'd never think you were a doctor.
You didn't tell me then.


00:28:02.335 --> 00:28:08.422
I didn't want to ruin a great night.
Guys like to think girls are vulnerable.


00:28:09.049 --> 00:28:14.011
Alright, no hairline
fractures, which is great.


00:28:14.805 --> 00:28:17.723
This looks good. Too.


00:28:25.148 --> 00:28:26.482
Does this hurt?


00:28:26.733 --> 00:28:28.067
Nope.


00:28:40.538 --> 00:28:41.872
Sorry.


00:28:42.582 --> 00:28:45.918
I know it hurts, but I had to examine it.


00:28:49.423 --> 00:28:51.632
Watch your head.


00:28:54.469 --> 00:28:56.679
Joint injury and a hematoma.


00:28:57.389 --> 00:28:59.284
So. You're the Chief of
Medicine at the base?


00:28:59.308 --> 00:29:03.561
Not even close. The chief is from Burdenko.


00:29:03.854 --> 00:29:06.708
He spent the morning dissecting a bear.


00:29:06.732 --> 00:29:09.232
I can't wait for them
to remove it from here.


00:29:10.818 --> 00:29:12.110
It's pretty insane.


00:29:12.361 --> 00:29:13.653
Tell me about it.


00:29:13.946 --> 00:29:19.326
You're on bed rest now,
you'll be back in the barrack soon.


00:29:20.119 --> 00:29:22.931
I might drop by tonight...


00:29:22.955 --> 00:29:25.123
for a visit.


00:29:31.547 --> 00:29:35.342
How could hundreds of bears
deliberately attack the outpost?


00:29:35.676 --> 00:29:38.654
I know someone who could help us
get to the bottom of this.


00:29:38.678 --> 00:29:40.471
I'd like to meet that person.


00:29:41.264 --> 00:29:43.849
Have you heard about the Sensors?


00:29:44.726 --> 00:29:46.602
Are you talking about the people


00:29:47.437 --> 00:29:51.023
who supposedly got superpowers
after the primary events?


00:29:51.775 --> 00:29:53.400
The Sensors do exist.


00:29:56.237 --> 00:29:57.446
I actually studied them.


00:29:57.697 --> 00:30:01.617
They don't bend spoons or move glasses,
they're not superheroes.


00:30:02.160 --> 00:30:04.244
But, they know something we don't.


00:30:04.871 --> 00:30:08.624
Their minds receive data
like radios receive signals.


00:30:13.712 --> 00:30:15.815
However. We can't decipher the data.


00:30:15.839 --> 00:30:18.383
We don't know how they became this way,
either.


00:30:19.009 --> 00:30:20.927
I've selected the strongest one,


00:30:21.345 --> 00:30:23.513
but he was hurt during the primary event.


00:30:24.431 --> 00:30:26.557
He's in a military hospital right now.


00:30:27.768 --> 00:30:30.520
His abilities could be useful to us.


00:30:46.119 --> 00:30:47.244
Who are you?


00:30:48.079 --> 00:30:49.454
I'm Zhenya.


00:30:49.872 --> 00:30:51.081
I was sent by Id.


00:30:51.374 --> 00:30:52.374
Who is that?


00:30:52.500 --> 00:30:55.002
You can ask questions later.
Listen carefully.


00:30:55.378 --> 00:30:58.046
The first wave destroyed all electronics.


00:30:58.464 --> 00:31:02.384
The second launched the self-destruction
of all biological organisms.


00:31:02.593 --> 00:31:04.011
The third wave...


00:31:04.637 --> 00:31:07.639
will make anyone still alive in
the quarantine zone attack us.


00:31:07.849 --> 00:31:09.558
But, that hasn't happened yet.


00:31:09.851 --> 00:31:11.662
We have time to stop it from happening.


00:31:11.686 --> 00:31:13.061
What do you mean?


00:31:14.605 --> 00:31:16.314
Who's out there?


00:31:16.816 --> 00:31:18.817
There are 160 million of them.


00:31:20.778 --> 00:31:21.820
People?


00:31:22.030 --> 00:31:23.447
Not exactly.


00:31:24.615 --> 00:31:26.283
Their free will is gone.


00:31:26.659 --> 00:31:30.287
And it'll never come back,
which makes them more dangerous.


00:31:30.455 --> 00:31:32.456
However. Id knows how to stop them.


00:31:34.208 --> 00:31:35.792
And you will help him.


00:31:36.794 --> 00:31:39.129
You'll help find the one
who controls them.


00:31:39.964 --> 00:31:41.797
You must have seen him.


00:31:45.093 --> 00:31:46.469
I don't want to.


00:31:47.763 --> 00:31:49.096
I don't want this.


00:31:50.015 --> 00:31:51.140
Leave.


00:31:52.350 --> 00:31:53.726
Get out of here!


00:31:53.977 --> 00:31:55.895
Somebody, get him out of here!


00:31:56.772 --> 00:31:58.189
Are you alright?


00:31:58.899 --> 00:32:00.900
Arrest him. How did he get in here?


00:32:01.068 --> 00:32:03.027
Why did you let him in?


00:32:03.528 --> 00:32:04.737
Who?


00:32:07.949 --> 00:32:09.492
This guy.


00:32:10.285 --> 00:32:12.786
He's right here! Are you messing with me?


00:32:16.165 --> 00:32:17.332
I'll get the doctor.


00:32:18.250 --> 00:32:19.751
What's happening?


00:32:20.044 --> 00:32:22.170
What the hell is happening?


00:32:22.755 --> 00:32:25.924
Captain. But there's no one else in here
but us.


00:32:27.760 --> 00:32:29.863
I didn't need to get inside the hospital.


00:32:29.887 --> 00:32:32.430
All I had to do was get in there.


00:32:40.272 --> 00:32:41.815
I think he's hallucinating.


00:32:42.315 --> 00:32:44.441
He says someone else is in the room.


00:32:54.327 --> 00:32:56.328
I feel like I'm hallucinating.


00:32:56.871 --> 00:32:58.789
You're lucky you passed out.


00:33:00.250 --> 00:33:01.583
It was ugly out there.


00:33:03.044 --> 00:33:04.628
They aren't easy to kill.


00:33:04.838 --> 00:33:05.838
No shit.


00:33:06.089 --> 00:33:08.632
And we have no clue
who's in the quarantine zone.


00:33:10.468 --> 00:33:12.928
It wasn't a bear that took Kolya's gun.


00:33:13.220 --> 00:33:14.345
That's true.


00:33:17.015 --> 00:33:18.141
How is your mom?


00:33:18.308 --> 00:33:19.475
She's not answering.


00:33:21.436 --> 00:33:23.521
I asked a neighbor to check in on her.


00:33:24.064 --> 00:33:25.940
She says my mom's fine.


00:33:28.652 --> 00:33:30.194
How is your family? Alive?


00:33:32.781 --> 00:33:34.365
They stayed in Samara.


00:33:35.284 --> 00:33:36.827
My parents...


00:33:39.330 --> 00:33:41.456
I had a bad fight with Mom then.


00:33:41.833 --> 00:33:44.667
She didn't want me to go,
she always hated the military.


00:33:44.835 --> 00:33:45.960
How come?


00:33:46.753 --> 00:33:48.379
My brother died in Syria.


00:33:48.964 --> 00:33:51.132
Dad always compared me to him.


00:33:51.383 --> 00:33:53.801
He raised him, and I'm the mamma's boy.


00:33:54.720 --> 00:33:56.512
So. I decided to prove him wrong...


00:33:57.431 --> 00:33:58.848
and went to serve, too.


00:33:59.558 --> 00:34:02.894
Mom couldn't accept my brother's death,
and there I was...


00:34:04.188 --> 00:34:06.416
When it all began a month and a half ago,


00:34:06.440 --> 00:34:09.108
I tried calling them, but it was too late.


00:34:11.195 --> 00:34:12.904
We never spoke again.


00:34:15.448 --> 00:34:18.158
How are you feeling. Sergeant?


00:34:19.744 --> 00:34:22.204
A combat medic, huh?
Who could've thought?


00:34:22.538 --> 00:34:23.872
Was that a compliment?


00:34:24.373 --> 00:34:25.749
You tell me.


00:34:26.959 --> 00:34:29.169
I need to change your friend's dressing.


00:34:29.378 --> 00:34:32.088
It won't look pretty. Will you excuse us?


00:34:36.177 --> 00:34:37.844
Alright, that sounds serious.


00:34:46.686 --> 00:34:47.853
How are you?


00:34:48.146 --> 00:34:49.146
I'm fine.


00:34:49.731 --> 00:34:52.418
I signed your 3-day leave pass for Moscow.


00:34:52.442 --> 00:34:55.213
You'll see a physical therapist
for three days


00:34:55.237 --> 00:34:56.612
and be as good as new.


00:34:57.405 --> 00:35:00.115
Prepare to move out.


00:35:00.867 --> 00:35:03.077
Everyone. Get in position.


00:35:05.330 --> 00:35:06.622
Let's do it.


00:35:07.415 --> 00:35:08.916
Raven-1 is ready.


00:35:09.376 --> 00:35:10.709
Raven-2 is ready.


00:35:11.294 --> 00:35:12.628
Raven-3 is ready.


00:35:12.921 --> 00:35:14.296
Vulture-1 is ready.


00:35:14.756 --> 00:35:15.880
Vulture-2 is ready.


00:35:18.008 --> 00:35:19.467
Bustard-1 is ready.


00:35:19.969 --> 00:35:21.052
Bustard-2 is ready.


00:35:22.805 --> 00:35:23.888
Hello, boys.


00:35:24.265 --> 00:35:25.473
Good evening. Ma'am.


00:35:26.100 --> 00:35:27.892
Say hello to Moscow for me.


00:35:29.103 --> 00:35:30.687
Have a good time for me.


00:35:31.063 --> 00:35:32.814
Not with my leg!


00:36:13.605 --> 00:36:15.315
I don't know what to say.


00:36:15.941 --> 00:36:17.149
Why am I here?


00:36:17.400 --> 00:36:18.608
Yes.


00:36:19.277 --> 00:36:21.380
Because it's my military duty.


00:36:21.404 --> 00:36:23.447
I want to help. To be a part of this.


00:36:23.823 --> 00:36:28.035
Do you have any rage?
Any desire to get revenge?


00:36:28.953 --> 00:36:30.662
So many people have died.


00:36:30.955 --> 00:36:34.041
Most of the population is gone,
we've all lost someone.


00:36:35.752 --> 00:36:36.960
I didn't have anyone.


00:36:38.588 --> 00:36:40.172
Well, except for my mother.


00:36:40.882 --> 00:36:43.091
She's in Moscow. Alive.


00:36:45.428 --> 00:36:47.137
What did you do before all this?


00:36:47.388 --> 00:36:48.679
I worked.


00:36:49.014 --> 00:36:50.306
I drove a cab.


00:36:50.682 --> 00:36:51.807
Seriously?


00:36:54.728 --> 00:36:56.187
Can you turn off the camera?


00:36:58.106 --> 00:37:00.024
I don't want to say this on camera.


00:37:00.484 --> 00:37:02.651
I have a different opinion
about all this.


00:37:02.903 --> 00:37:04.445
I don't want to lie to people.


00:37:05.072 --> 00:37:07.782
Well, can you tell me? I want to know.


00:37:11.286 --> 00:37:13.829
Perhaps I don't mind that this happened.


00:37:15.540 --> 00:37:17.917
In my case, it gave my life meaning.


00:37:18.542 --> 00:37:21.920
I was nobody as a civilian,
and here, I make a difference.


00:37:23.631 --> 00:37:25.757
Don't you feel sorry for the people?


00:37:26.008 --> 00:37:27.717
No, I don't know them.


00:37:31.013 --> 00:37:34.117
I bet you don't care, either,
unless your loved ones got hurt.


00:37:34.141 --> 00:37:36.476
Only 0.5% of the population survived.


00:37:36.936 --> 00:37:39.938
That means that for every survivor.
There are 1,000 dead.


00:37:40.439 --> 00:37:43.400
I'm 1 out of 1,000, you're 1 out of 1,000.


00:37:44.777 --> 00:37:46.986
Just like everyone else in this vehicle.


00:37:47.196 --> 00:37:49.488
I think it's pretty awesome. Isn't it?


00:38:28.820 --> 00:38:32.281
There's total devastation ahead,
the convoy cannot move further.


00:38:32.824 --> 00:38:36.368
I see destroyed tanks.
One's turret was blown off.


00:38:41.916 --> 00:38:44.251
The third wave has already begun.


00:38:57.097 --> 00:39:00.600
The recent footage
from the destroyed tank unit,


00:39:00.767 --> 00:39:03.352
which was sent out to study
the quarantine zone,


00:39:03.562 --> 00:39:06.147
shocked the public
and led to a new wave of panic.


00:39:09.026 --> 00:39:11.652
Even though there are no signs
of enemy presence


00:39:11.862 --> 00:39:13.696
or any direct impact...


00:39:13.906 --> 00:39:15.907
...many experts believe...


00:39:16.158 --> 00:39:18.493
...we're currently in a state of war.


00:39:19.953 --> 00:39:22.078
The armored unit
was destroyed by weapons,


00:39:22.330 --> 00:39:24.748
and clearly, someone controlled
those weapons.


00:39:24.916 --> 00:39:26.750
Therefore. We have an enemy.


00:39:27.084 --> 00:39:31.671
Frankly, this is a new form of warfare
that hasn't been used before.


00:39:32.215 --> 00:39:33.298
That's even scarier.


00:39:33.508 --> 00:39:37.010
There's a chance the government is hiding
who we're really fighting.


00:39:37.220 --> 00:39:41.723
The only possible result of this
is panic and total chaos.


00:39:45.061 --> 00:39:49.231
Truly, things aren't easy for those
who've survived.


00:39:49.482 --> 00:39:53.609
People don't know what to expect,
many stopped going to work.


00:39:53.777 --> 00:39:56.278
I don't think it was this bad
even in the 90s.


00:39:56.571 --> 00:39:59.698
I can't go outside
without fear of being robbed.


00:40:02.410 --> 00:40:06.288
The authorities say nothing,
they just keep sending more soldiers.


00:40:07.749 --> 00:40:11.126
Why won't they tell us the truth?
We have the right to know.


00:40:11.628 --> 00:40:13.712
We're people and we're terrified.


00:40:16.675 --> 00:40:19.260
Crime rates in the cities have gone up.


00:40:20.220 --> 00:40:22.637
There have been more reports
of store robberies.


00:40:22.805 --> 00:40:24.889
Giving in to the general panic,


00:40:25.140 --> 00:40:27.475
people pillage grocery store shelves,


00:40:27.643 --> 00:40:31.729
looting huge stockpiles of food,
and stocking up on supplies.


00:40:36.193 --> 00:40:39.070
Supreme High Command's
position is that


00:40:39.363 --> 00:40:42.365
we're fighting an
unknown group of people.


00:40:42.700 --> 00:40:44.784
After all that we've witnessed,


00:40:45.202 --> 00:40:49.706
it's safe to assume they use weapons
found in the quarantine zone.


00:40:50.082 --> 00:40:52.333
Considering the size of that area,


00:40:52.960 --> 00:40:55.420
the number of military bases, and so on,


00:40:55.713 --> 00:40:59.132
they have access to nearly every kind
of weapon available.


00:40:59.341 --> 00:41:02.927
However. We haven't detected the movement
of any military hardware.


00:41:03.137 --> 00:41:06.366
Therefore. We're preparing a series
of special operations.


00:41:06.390 --> 00:41:10.560
We must take control of that area and move
deeper into the quarantine zone


00:41:10.853 --> 00:41:15.315
to determine the location of the enemy
and their approximate number.


00:41:15.524 --> 00:41:18.401
We have small recon teams
who will take on the mission.


00:41:18.569 --> 00:41:20.380
In case of contact
with the enemy,


00:41:20.404 --> 00:41:23.174
we'll send reinforcements
and deploy additional troops


00:41:23.198 --> 00:41:24.615
from our base of operations.


00:41:24.824 --> 00:41:26.510
It will not be an easy mission.


00:41:26.534 --> 00:41:30.245
They are to secure a foothold
and set up an observation post.


00:41:30.788 --> 00:41:32.933
We'll set up communications
and supply lines,


00:41:32.957 --> 00:41:35.375
they'll have to live in the zone.


00:41:35.877 --> 00:41:38.337
We can no longer sit around and wait.


00:41:38.921 --> 00:41:43.967
We must act despite the high risk
of making a mistake.


00:41:46.471 --> 00:41:49.681
HQ, this is Traveler-7,
we're 10 km away from the checkpoint.


00:41:49.849 --> 00:41:52.100
Copy that, Traveler-7.


00:41:53.061 --> 00:41:55.353
What if we run into someone?


00:41:57.064 --> 00:41:58.856
Why do you ask?


00:42:00.275 --> 00:42:02.276
I want to know what to do.


00:42:03.945 --> 00:42:05.738
In your case, scream.


00:42:07.324 --> 00:42:08.991
Yeah? And in your case?


00:42:12.537 --> 00:42:15.331
Do you want to go back
before we go too far?


00:42:16.667 --> 00:42:18.292
Do you want to go back?


00:42:18.460 --> 00:42:22.421
Lieutenant, relax, she didn't mean that.
We're all stressed.


00:42:29.929 --> 00:42:31.054
It's OK.


00:42:36.894 --> 00:42:40.897
Where's your helper guy?
The cameraman?


00:42:41.273 --> 00:42:43.692
He went to Moscow to see his family.


00:42:44.944 --> 00:42:47.237
I can handle the camera.


00:42:47.822 --> 00:42:48.947
Petrov!


00:42:49.323 --> 00:42:50.699
Hold this.


00:42:51.450 --> 00:42:52.617
Come here.


00:42:55.662 --> 00:42:57.037
What about you?


00:42:57.330 --> 00:42:59.581
Don't you have a family to go to?


00:43:00.583 --> 00:43:02.209
I guess I don't.


00:43:05.588 --> 00:43:06.755
Put me down.


00:43:18.351 --> 00:43:19.810
This is a small village.


00:43:20.186 --> 00:43:23.398
Let's clear every house before we dig in.


00:43:24.358 --> 00:43:27.276
Then, we can choose the best location.


00:43:27.527 --> 00:43:29.111
Turn on the local channel.


00:43:32.490 --> 00:43:35.534
Team 1 takes the left side,
Team 2 takes the right.


00:44:20.621 --> 00:44:21.871
What's wrong, Senchuk?


00:44:27.628 --> 00:44:30.212
Spread out, keep your eyes open.


00:44:31.005 --> 00:44:32.107
Did you see them?


00:44:32.131 --> 00:44:36.426
There was no one. I opened the container,
and this shit fell out.


00:44:36.928 --> 00:44:38.094
Dammit!


00:44:38.262 --> 00:44:39.554
Are you serious?


00:44:40.306 --> 00:44:41.932
We need to take it out.


00:44:42.975 --> 00:44:44.810
Wait, take it out?


00:44:45.061 --> 00:44:47.103
Wait, don't do that!


00:44:56.906 --> 00:44:59.782
It's getting dark,
we should continue in the morning.


00:45:00.116 --> 00:45:02.535
Let's find a good spot for observation.


00:45:02.744 --> 00:45:04.870
Let's move toward that building.


00:45:05.747 --> 00:45:07.289
It provides a good view.


00:45:08.333 --> 00:45:10.251
Check every door...


00:45:11.044 --> 00:45:14.463
if they're unlocked or broken into,
check the apartments.


00:45:18.426 --> 00:45:19.718
What are they doing?


00:45:19.928 --> 00:45:22.972
It's a tracking radar,
it sees people through walls.


00:45:23.265 --> 00:45:24.723
Like in Predator.


00:45:26.768 --> 00:45:27.935
Clear.


00:45:31.730 --> 00:45:32.897
Where do we go?


00:45:33.107 --> 00:45:37.944
Ninth floor. It has roof access, so we can
fast-rope down if we need to bug out.


00:45:38.237 --> 00:45:39.445
Clear.


00:45:43.784 --> 00:45:46.579
Major, Team 2 is clearing
their location.


00:45:46.830 --> 00:45:49.081
Team 4 is in position.


00:45:49.499 --> 00:45:50.875
Did they send a doctor?


00:45:51.126 --> 00:45:52.668
He's leaving tomorrow.


00:45:52.961 --> 00:45:55.880
Team 7 is in Kirov on recon detail.


00:45:56.715 --> 00:45:58.799
- Who's the Lieutenant in 7?
- Kasatkin.


00:45:59.467 --> 00:46:01.926
- That's the one with the girl.
- Yes, sir.


00:46:02.720 --> 00:46:04.512
Keep an eye on them.


00:46:08.392 --> 00:46:10.852
Traveler-4, come in.


00:46:11.812 --> 00:46:13.396
Traveler-4 here. Over.


00:46:14.273 --> 00:46:15.481
We're approaching.


00:46:15.774 --> 00:46:16.983
Copy that.


00:46:36.544 --> 00:46:37.794
Alyona!


00:46:38.338 --> 00:46:39.398
Yes.


00:46:39.422 --> 00:46:41.173
- So they sent you?
- Yes. Hi.


00:46:43.092 --> 00:46:44.134
Sorry.


00:46:47.221 --> 00:46:49.264
- Where is he?
- Inside.


00:46:55.647 --> 00:46:57.356
Come, we need help.


00:47:03.403 --> 00:47:06.739
You did a good job cleaning the wound.
For a soldier.


00:47:07.240 --> 00:47:08.741
Thanks a lot.


00:47:09.076 --> 00:47:10.868
I still need to bring him in.


00:47:11.286 --> 00:47:12.328
It's deep.


00:47:12.955 --> 00:47:15.581
Bring me in? It's not that deep.


00:47:15.832 --> 00:47:19.085
Give me some painkillers,
and I'll dance for you.


00:47:19.378 --> 00:47:21.295
Don't bring me in, they need me here.


00:47:24.216 --> 00:47:26.926
It's your call, you're the boss.


00:47:31.681 --> 00:47:33.056
Sorry, man.


00:47:33.391 --> 00:47:35.934
If it gets infected.
We'll need to amputate.


00:47:37.853 --> 00:47:38.979
Freaking cripples.


00:47:53.619 --> 00:47:54.661
Olya.


00:47:56.831 --> 00:47:58.039
Get up.


00:47:59.250 --> 00:48:00.625
How did you sleep?


00:48:01.669 --> 00:48:03.460
Surprisingly well.


00:48:04.546 --> 00:48:05.921
Is everything OK?


00:48:06.172 --> 00:48:07.256
Yes. It's all quiet.


00:48:07.507 --> 00:48:09.466
Sorry, I decided to wake you up.


00:48:10.135 --> 00:48:12.262
Your breakfast is getting cold.


00:48:13.222 --> 00:48:14.848
What, do we have something hot?


00:48:16.475 --> 00:48:18.560
It'll be the best hot breakfast ever.


00:48:24.191 --> 00:48:25.233
Hello.


00:48:29.947 --> 00:48:31.614
Good morning.


00:48:33.033 --> 00:48:34.575
It smells so good.


00:48:36.661 --> 00:48:37.953
Have a seat.


00:48:44.586 --> 00:48:47.463
It's good. Do you always eat like this
in the Army?


00:48:48.298 --> 00:48:49.715
It's just canned beef.


00:48:53.470 --> 00:48:55.304
You wouldn't eat this back home.


00:48:55.513 --> 00:49:00.017
Here, when you're at death's doorstep,
food tastes different.


00:49:04.146 --> 00:49:05.730
Same goes for sex.


00:49:07.733 --> 00:49:10.860
I guess I'll take your word on that one.


00:49:11.153 --> 00:49:12.714
Listen, Mr. Pickup Guru,


00:49:12.738 --> 00:49:14.739
your turn to watch the window.


00:49:33.759 --> 00:49:34.800
Olya.


00:49:36.177 --> 00:49:38.845
Did you film when we were
approaching the building?


00:49:39.305 --> 00:49:40.305
I did. Why?


00:49:40.932 --> 00:49:41.932
Let me see.


00:49:48.689 --> 00:49:50.857
Which one is from last night?


00:49:56.322 --> 00:49:58.782
Look, the door to the store was closed.


00:50:00.618 --> 00:50:01.660
Son of a bitch.


00:50:04.580 --> 00:50:05.579
Could be the wind.


00:50:05.789 --> 00:50:07.832
If the wind closed it, sure...


00:50:08.208 --> 00:50:09.959
but not open it.


00:50:39.030 --> 00:50:41.157
I'm glad you're feeling better.


00:50:45.579 --> 00:50:47.071
Who are you?


00:50:47.080 --> 00:50:51.208
Zhenya told you about me.
My name is Id.


00:50:51.793 --> 00:50:53.544
I'm hallucinating again.


00:50:54.254 --> 00:50:56.338
It's alright, I'm really here.


00:50:56.882 --> 00:50:58.924
Zhenya only had a mental connection.


00:50:59.551 --> 00:51:01.302
I had connected your minds then.


00:51:01.678 --> 00:51:03.762
We don't have much time, Sasha.


00:51:04.472 --> 00:51:07.098
You were on the border
during the first wave.


00:51:07.558 --> 00:51:10.894
You didn't become a slave,
but you're no longer a regular human.


00:51:11.353 --> 00:51:12.437
You're different.


00:51:12.813 --> 00:51:15.356
You can find the one who controls them.


00:51:15.858 --> 00:51:17.400
You saw him, didn't you?


00:51:19.445 --> 00:51:20.445
I did.


00:51:20.654 --> 00:51:24.115
I didn't see his face, but I know
who you're talking about.


00:51:24.283 --> 00:51:26.201
- It was a dream.
- Where is he?


00:51:26.368 --> 00:51:29.370
I don't know. I can't help you.
Do you understand?


00:51:35.961 --> 00:51:37.836
You must come with me.


00:51:42.300 --> 00:51:43.592
Sasha!


00:51:46.888 --> 00:51:48.931
Step away from him!
Sasha, who is that?


00:51:49.599 --> 00:51:51.183
We have an intruder!


00:52:04.781 --> 00:52:06.698
What do you see?


00:52:09.576 --> 00:52:11.077
Clear. No movement.


00:52:18.919 --> 00:52:20.628
What are they saying?


00:52:21.922 --> 00:52:23.297
Nothing yet.


00:52:49.407 --> 00:52:50.865
The building is clear.


00:52:53.911 --> 00:52:55.453
Someone was here.


00:53:00.543 --> 00:53:02.794
Looks like they come here for the food.


00:53:05.716 --> 00:53:07.091
What do you think?


00:53:07.467 --> 00:53:10.218
I say we recoup,
can't miss this opportunity.


00:53:12.221 --> 00:53:13.805
Set up an ambush.


00:53:14.098 --> 00:53:15.181
That's smart.


00:53:15.474 --> 00:53:17.183
Do you have your grenade?


00:53:17.643 --> 00:53:18.852
Set up traps.


00:53:19.937 --> 00:53:22.022
I will not repeat myself.
Step away!


00:53:29.613 --> 00:53:31.865
What the hell are you doing?


00:53:37.038 --> 00:53:39.664
If he moves, take him down!


00:53:59.225 --> 00:54:01.101
I didn't have to resort to that,


00:54:01.394 --> 00:54:05.731
but a short demonstration of power
is more effective than a long explanation.


00:54:06.608 --> 00:54:09.902
Do you think I could make them
pull the trigger?


00:54:14.156 --> 00:54:15.156
That's right.


00:54:15.741 --> 00:54:18.159
Millions just like me will be here soon.


00:54:18.452 --> 00:54:20.703
They will all want the same thing...


00:54:21.038 --> 00:54:22.330
to destroy you.


00:54:23.040 --> 00:54:24.540
All of you.


00:54:25.542 --> 00:54:27.085
I am on your side.


00:54:27.878 --> 00:54:30.755
We don't have much time,
but if you hear me out,


00:54:31.006 --> 00:54:32.507
I'll try to convince you.


00:54:32.758 --> 00:54:34.550
You're not human. Who are you?


00:54:35.719 --> 00:54:38.638
In your language.
I am what you'd call...


00:54:38.806 --> 00:54:40.014
a god.


00:54:40.724 --> 00:54:43.016
I'm ready to answer all your questions.


00:54:43.309 --> 00:54:45.227
But we're running out of time.


00:54:56.531 --> 00:54:57.906
Kolya, what do you see?


00:54:59.367 --> 00:55:00.492
Nothing.


00:55:01.327 --> 00:55:04.871
I don't think we'll see them today
if they already got their food.


00:55:06.457 --> 00:55:07.707
How's it going?


00:55:08.376 --> 00:55:09.876
It's going.


00:55:10.711 --> 00:55:13.212
I don't understand everything
that's happening.


00:55:13.463 --> 00:55:15.673
I'm describing our lieutenant for now.


00:55:17.217 --> 00:55:18.342
I see.


00:55:23.807 --> 00:55:25.307
What about your husband?


00:55:26.143 --> 00:55:29.019
Is he worried you're here,
on the front line?


00:55:30.523 --> 00:55:32.524
We have a complicated relationship.


00:55:33.693 --> 00:55:34.943
How come?


00:55:36.154 --> 00:55:39.531
Sometimes, the love is gone,
but people are afraid to break up.


00:55:40.241 --> 00:55:42.575
And sometimes, it goes on for too long.


00:55:44.369 --> 00:55:45.494
Men.


00:55:45.954 --> 00:55:47.246
I see movement.


00:55:50.792 --> 00:55:52.209
The trap worked.


00:55:52.794 --> 00:55:54.462
We're moving out.


00:55:56.298 --> 00:55:58.507
- What about me? I...
- You stay here.


00:55:58.884 --> 00:56:02.678
If a firefight breaks out, and we
don't answer on the radio. Use this.


00:56:03.388 --> 00:56:05.556
There are two signal flares,
purple and red.


00:56:05.765 --> 00:56:07.994
Purple means we were attacked
and need help.


00:56:08.018 --> 00:56:09.643
- And the red one?
- Red equals dead.


00:56:09.811 --> 00:56:12.021
"Team is destroyed. Don't expect help."


00:57:06.533 --> 00:57:07.741
Here!


00:57:18.252 --> 00:57:19.544
Holy shit.


00:57:21.004 --> 00:57:22.922
- He's alive.
- Check for fractures.


00:57:23.131 --> 00:57:24.257
What's happening?


00:57:24.591 --> 00:57:27.927
Teenager, about 14, set off the tripwire.
Limbs intact.


00:57:28.345 --> 00:57:30.054
What the hell?


00:57:31.473 --> 00:57:33.182
Is he alone out here?


00:57:35.936 --> 00:57:36.936
Put the camera away.


00:57:37.104 --> 00:57:39.021
I said there could be civilians here.


00:57:39.189 --> 00:57:40.856
Do you hear me? Put it away!


00:57:41.108 --> 00:57:43.150
- I hear you.
- Be quiet.


00:57:43.527 --> 00:57:45.652
He looks fine, let's take him.


00:57:47.822 --> 00:57:50.592
Are you saying it's all
due to some radiation


00:57:50.616 --> 00:57:55.328
that apparently turned 160 million people
into mindless alien puppets?


00:57:55.580 --> 00:57:57.206
To put it simply. Yes.


00:57:57.541 --> 00:58:00.835
I was supposed to give the order
to begin the irradiation process


00:58:01.044 --> 00:58:02.837
once the moon is above the ocean.


00:58:03.005 --> 00:58:07.091
But, I gave the order when
the moon covered this part of the planet.


00:58:07.301 --> 00:58:11.345
The radiation didn't reach it,
that's why the Circle of Life appeared.


00:58:11.638 --> 00:58:15.724
Those beyond the circle no longer
have control over their own minds.


00:58:15.933 --> 00:58:18.518
They simply follow orders,
like drones.


00:58:18.978 --> 00:58:23.064
Soon. They'll gather around the circle
and attack you.


00:58:23.274 --> 00:58:26.026
It'll begin the third wave
of colonization.


00:58:26.360 --> 00:58:28.236
Why do you need our planet?


00:58:28.487 --> 00:58:30.614
Our star was doomed to burn out.


00:58:30.823 --> 00:58:32.616
We looked for a new place to live.


00:58:32.908 --> 00:58:36.536
Your planet is perfect,
your sun is a relatively young star.


00:58:37.038 --> 00:58:39.706
This planet will be habitable
for a long time.


00:58:39.915 --> 00:58:42.459
So you want to destroy us?


00:58:43.002 --> 00:58:45.587
And that's why you need
the colonization waves.


00:58:45.796 --> 00:58:48.589
Actually, there was also...


00:58:49.090 --> 00:58:51.258
a wave number zero.


00:58:51.843 --> 00:58:54.511
According to our race's
colonization system,


00:58:54.763 --> 00:58:57.598
wave zero is a biological attack


00:58:57.891 --> 00:59:02.519
that was supposed to subdue the planet
while the ships were on the way.


00:59:02.771 --> 00:59:03.854
Who is that?


00:59:04.022 --> 00:59:05.272
Cover us.


00:59:05.482 --> 00:59:08.776
Our solar system is far away from yours.


00:59:09.736 --> 00:59:11.111
I don't understand.


00:59:11.279 --> 00:59:15.199
Since our colonization ship is unable
to travel at light speed,


00:59:15.450 --> 00:59:21.287
we send a smaller ship with bioweapons
through hyperspace.


00:59:21.747 --> 00:59:24.165
It reaches the target almost instantly.


00:59:24.750 --> 00:59:27.710
Then, the Armada moves out.


00:59:28.170 --> 00:59:31.422
By the time the Armada arrives
in 200,000 years,


00:59:31.799 --> 00:59:34.550
the planet is ready for new inhabitants.


00:59:36.261 --> 00:59:39.389
So they're only coming in 200,000 years?


00:59:40.099 --> 00:59:42.225
No, they arrive tomorrow.


00:59:48.606 --> 00:59:49.708
What have we here?


00:59:49.732 --> 00:59:52.401
Didn't the recon team say
there was no one out there?


00:59:53.152 --> 00:59:55.862
He has barotrauma,
or maybe it's jjust a concussion.


00:59:57.073 --> 01:00:00.575
It's not too bad, we can help him.
I'll get the medkit.


01:00:00.785 --> 01:00:03.078
Here, drink this. How are you?


01:00:12.797 --> 01:00:14.214
What happened?


01:00:15.049 --> 01:00:16.591
What do you remember?


01:00:17.093 --> 01:00:19.969
I went inside the store to get food.


01:00:20.637 --> 01:00:22.889
- I do it almost every night.
- Go on.


01:00:23.182 --> 01:00:25.934
I didn't know anyone else survived.


01:00:27.395 --> 01:00:29.521
I thought everyone was dead.


01:00:33.234 --> 01:00:35.110
Son of a bitch!


01:00:39.824 --> 01:00:42.200
- Had enough war, did you?
- Fuck off.


01:00:44.162 --> 01:00:45.871
How are the others doing?


01:00:46.581 --> 01:00:48.749
I'm not sure, but I think they're fine.


01:00:55.005 --> 01:00:56.005
Be careful, OK?


01:00:56.214 --> 01:00:57.256
You too.


01:01:06.016 --> 01:01:07.808
Movement detected.


01:01:08.268 --> 01:01:11.437
This wave number zero,
the biological attack...


01:01:11.688 --> 01:01:15.316
Did you prevent it? Or did it jjust fail?


01:01:15.776 --> 01:01:18.152
On the contrary. It worked very well.


01:01:18.403 --> 01:01:19.819
Our weapons are perfect.


01:01:20.029 --> 01:01:22.697
Once it reaches the planet,
it starts spreading,


01:01:22.948 --> 01:01:25.325
attacking all forms of life present.


01:01:25.576 --> 01:01:28.077
It either destroys them or enslaves them.


01:01:28.287 --> 01:01:32.290
That's how we got rid
of the Earth's developed race.


01:01:32.917 --> 01:01:34.083
You mean us?


01:01:34.418 --> 01:01:38.046
You don't actually think
that people built the pyramids?


01:01:38.297 --> 01:01:39.923
And the underwater cities?


01:01:41.717 --> 01:01:42.842
What are you saying?


01:01:43.636 --> 01:01:45.053
Don't worry.


01:01:45.304 --> 01:01:46.805
Look, what's your name?


01:01:47.139 --> 01:01:48.181
Styopa.


01:01:48.390 --> 01:01:49.432
I'm Maxim.


01:01:49.642 --> 01:01:50.808
Are you in charge?


01:01:51.017 --> 01:01:53.435
Yes. I'm a lieutenant, I'm in charge here.


01:01:53.770 --> 01:01:54.978
We will take you to...


01:02:02.737 --> 01:02:05.531
Mankind itself is our weapon.


01:02:10.328 --> 01:02:12.704
You are our perfect invaders.


01:02:12.914 --> 01:02:14.081
The perfect virus.


01:02:14.332 --> 01:02:18.085
You wiped out the original population,
making room for us.


01:02:18.711 --> 01:02:20.629
Look how alike we are.


01:02:20.964 --> 01:02:24.507
Two races from different solar systems
can't be this similar.


01:02:25.050 --> 01:02:26.717
We have the same DNA.


01:02:26.969 --> 01:02:29.679
So. We... are you?


01:02:29.972 --> 01:02:34.350
"God created man in His own image..."


01:02:34.935 --> 01:02:38.771
But, to be specific. You're the product
of our genetic engineering.


01:02:39.273 --> 01:02:41.315
You're a truncated version of us.


01:02:41.859 --> 01:02:44.944
We took away your psionic abilities.


01:02:45.195 --> 01:02:49.324
We gave you your drive to mate.
Which awoke your primal instincts.


01:02:49.701 --> 01:02:52.118
Combined with your emotions and mortality,


01:02:52.327 --> 01:02:56.289
they result in your need to procreate
thoughtlessly and vigorously.


01:02:56.915 --> 01:02:59.417
This way. The virus spread faster.


01:02:59.877 --> 01:03:04.046
As a result, you completed the mission
thousands of years sooner than expected.


01:03:04.339 --> 01:03:06.257
Men, what is happening?


01:03:06.717 --> 01:03:08.301
- The LT was KIA.
- What?


01:03:08.635 --> 01:03:09.696
By whom?


01:03:09.720 --> 01:03:12.346
The injured kid we picked up,
son of a bitch.


01:03:12.514 --> 01:03:13.806
What kid? Where is he?


01:03:14.016 --> 01:03:17.518
The LT is gone and so is the kid.
Get off the channel!


01:03:18.687 --> 01:03:20.730
What the hell? He was just a kid.


01:03:24.984 --> 01:03:27.277
Men, eyes open. I see a group of people.


01:03:28.362 --> 01:03:29.362
How many?


01:03:29.572 --> 01:03:31.197
A lot, and they're armed.


01:03:32.617 --> 01:03:34.993
You lack mercy and compassion.


01:03:35.328 --> 01:03:38.413
You're driven solely by procreation
and violence.


01:03:38.873 --> 01:03:42.542
When it comes to destroying lives.
There's no one like you.


01:03:42.710 --> 01:03:44.628
Movement detected.


01:03:45.212 --> 01:03:46.922
That's why waves one and two


01:03:47.131 --> 01:03:51.426
were supposed to take you out,
leaving only the slaves.


01:03:52.845 --> 01:03:54.470
Otherwise, you won't stop...


01:03:54.679 --> 01:03:57.014
until you destroy everything.


01:04:35.344 --> 01:04:37.178
Where are the shots coming from?


01:04:37.388 --> 01:04:38.471
From everywhere.


01:04:41.976 --> 01:04:43.434
Suppressive fire!


01:04:49.733 --> 01:04:53.069
Alyona! Hide!


01:04:53.529 --> 01:04:54.861
Hide!


01:04:55.613 --> 01:04:56.613
He's hurt!


01:04:57.240 --> 01:04:58.407
What?


01:05:34.610 --> 01:05:36.737
Let's get out of here! Now!


01:05:47.999 --> 01:05:50.042
Stay there and lie still.


01:05:52.712 --> 01:05:54.880
Radio in the attack, one injured!


01:05:55.048 --> 01:05:56.297
Yes. Sir!


01:05:59.885 --> 01:06:00.987
How is he?


01:06:01.011 --> 01:06:04.346
Fragment wound, but no signs
of internal bleeding.


01:06:04.556 --> 01:06:05.765
Motherfucker!


01:06:07.601 --> 01:06:09.643
Take cover!


01:06:15.067 --> 01:06:16.734
Get in the building!


01:06:19.821 --> 01:06:21.405
To the building!


01:06:23.992 --> 01:06:25.910
Seryoga, you alive?


01:06:26.161 --> 01:06:27.202
For now!


01:06:27.369 --> 01:06:28.972
Did you see where they fired from?


01:06:28.996 --> 01:06:30.872
From the building across from us.


01:06:34.919 --> 01:06:36.795
Ammunition exhausted


01:06:36.962 --> 01:06:38.004
Son of a bitch!


01:06:38.380 --> 01:06:40.131
Give me a status report.


01:06:40.633 --> 01:06:44.052
Lynx was taken out completely,
the resupply team can't return.


01:06:45.262 --> 01:06:46.262
The WIAs?


01:06:46.388 --> 01:06:48.264
Unclear. Requesting orders.


01:07:11.329 --> 01:07:14.873
Olya! Olya, get back! Take cover!


01:07:32.307 --> 01:07:34.100
David. Find an RPG.


01:07:34.309 --> 01:07:35.518
On it.


01:07:37.646 --> 01:07:39.522
There you are.


01:07:42.527 --> 01:07:43.777
Get down!


01:07:55.373 --> 01:07:56.748
This is nonsense.


01:07:57.542 --> 01:07:59.125
You have to believe it.


01:07:59.334 --> 01:08:03.629
The sooner you accept the truth,
the more chances you have to win.


01:08:04.298 --> 01:08:05.673
Not you, us.


01:08:05.924 --> 01:08:07.091
Us?


01:08:08.427 --> 01:08:09.844
Aren't you with them?


01:08:10.053 --> 01:08:11.470
You control them.


01:08:12.181 --> 01:08:13.389
Not exactly.


01:08:13.640 --> 01:08:17.185
I arrived on that ship with the virus,
someone else was with me.


01:08:17.394 --> 01:08:19.270
That was 200.000 years ago.


01:08:19.563 --> 01:08:22.148
We were supposed to supervise
your development


01:08:22.441 --> 01:08:24.567
and welcome our kind when they arrive.


01:08:24.860 --> 01:08:28.404
I was certain
I was the only survivor by now.


01:08:28.906 --> 01:08:30.363
But, I guess I was wrong.


01:08:36.954 --> 01:08:38.997
Men, the tank's dead.


01:08:39.290 --> 01:08:41.917
If you have any ideas, now is the time.


01:08:42.627 --> 01:08:44.711
Do it!


01:08:45.046 --> 01:08:46.379
Yes. Sir.


01:09:16.326 --> 01:09:17.618
Let's cover them!


01:09:17.827 --> 01:09:18.994
Let's do it.


01:09:44.561 --> 01:09:46.688
The one who controls them...


01:09:47.439 --> 01:09:48.690
he's the same as you?


01:09:49.066 --> 01:09:52.819
Exactly. His name is Ra,
he's their master.


01:09:53.237 --> 01:09:55.863
Together, they're a whole.


01:09:56.198 --> 01:09:57.490
We must kill him.


01:09:57.825 --> 01:10:00.868
Then I can take control of them
and neutralize them.


01:10:01.119 --> 01:10:04.705
But, first I need to find him,
that's why I'm here.


01:10:06.375 --> 01:10:07.375
Because of Sasha?


01:10:07.626 --> 01:10:09.252
He can see Ra.


01:10:09.837 --> 01:10:13.840
We must take him to the outpost,
close to the quarantine zone.


01:10:14.258 --> 01:10:16.426
My assistant and I are going with you.


01:10:17.928 --> 01:10:20.722
What if everything you told me is a lie...


01:10:22.474 --> 01:10:23.933
and you're on their side?


01:10:24.226 --> 01:10:27.937
You must decide
whether to believe me or not.


01:10:31.650 --> 01:10:32.858
Yes. I'm listening.


01:10:37.780 --> 01:10:38.864
Yes.


01:10:39.073 --> 01:10:41.074
Yes. Alright, I'm on my way.


01:10:46.497 --> 01:10:48.874
Our recon teams were attacked.


01:10:49.375 --> 01:10:51.960
They went on the offensive.


01:10:52.253 --> 01:10:53.462
We're wasting time.


01:11:30.207 --> 01:11:31.624
They killed Petya.


01:11:32.793 --> 01:11:34.626
Kolya is dead, too.


01:11:42.218 --> 01:11:43.968
They're coming from everywhere!


01:11:44.387 --> 01:11:46.388
Let's regroup!


01:11:54.522 --> 01:11:56.481
They're at the entrance.


01:12:03.364 --> 01:12:04.780
- Hold the door.
- Yes. Sir.


01:12:16.209 --> 01:12:17.376
Olya!


01:12:18.253 --> 01:12:19.753
The signal flare!


01:13:02.922 --> 01:13:04.756
Where is that? Which team?


01:13:05.132 --> 01:13:07.842
Looks like 7. In the direction of Kirov.


01:13:27.696 --> 01:13:29.530
The war has begun.


01:13:33.243 --> 01:13:35.161
Give me the WP.


01:13:45.922 --> 01:13:47.464
- Olya!
- Yes!


01:13:48.090 --> 01:13:49.841
Come with me! Let's go!


01:13:54.096 --> 01:13:55.472
Here. Let's go.


01:14:07.400 --> 01:14:08.901
They retreated.


01:14:09.152 --> 01:14:10.569
Hold the door.


01:14:11.238 --> 01:14:12.655
They won't be back soon.


01:14:12.989 --> 01:14:14.073
They're like ants!


01:14:14.324 --> 01:14:17.326
They're not afraid to die.
I took out like 40 of them!


01:14:20.205 --> 01:14:21.872
We got a few, too.


01:14:22.165 --> 01:14:24.083
Why are they attacking us?


01:14:26.670 --> 01:14:28.546
We don't know that yet.


01:14:28.964 --> 01:14:33.008
We have another problem. We need
to bug out of a compromised position.


01:14:33.927 --> 01:14:35.761
David. Get the fast rope ready.


01:14:36.012 --> 01:14:38.471
We can fasten it to that corner.


01:14:38.973 --> 01:14:41.057
Hopefully. They don't have us surrounded.


01:14:41.225 --> 01:14:43.059
Which is highly likely.


01:14:44.311 --> 01:14:45.562
Can't we call anyone?


01:14:45.813 --> 01:14:46.813
No.


01:14:47.064 --> 01:14:49.065
We have short-range communication.


01:14:49.483 --> 01:14:53.069
We launched the signal flare,
they know we need help.


01:14:53.279 --> 01:14:54.946
I saw more of those.


01:14:57.408 --> 01:14:58.409
How many?


01:14:58.577 --> 01:15:01.453
About seven or eight purple ones
and three red.


01:15:04.249 --> 01:15:05.958
What the fuck?


01:15:06.793 --> 01:15:08.918
Does that mean they're not coming for us?


01:15:09.211 --> 01:15:10.461
Well...


01:15:10.754 --> 01:15:13.381
that means we shouldn't count on it.


01:15:15.301 --> 01:15:17.427
Looks like a major attack.


01:15:20.431 --> 01:15:22.098
Alright, we're on our own.


01:15:22.558 --> 01:15:23.725
I'll take the rope.


01:15:24.018 --> 01:15:26.811
David. Be on the lookout,
they're too quiet.


01:15:42.785 --> 01:15:45.037
Are you even mortal?


01:15:46.539 --> 01:15:49.374
There's no such thing as immortality.


01:15:49.834 --> 01:15:51.979
But, I will live forever...


01:15:52.003 --> 01:15:53.897
If no one kills me.


01:15:53.921 --> 01:15:57.318
We can alter the structure of our bodies...


01:15:57.342 --> 01:16:00.446
renewing our cells.


01:16:00.470 --> 01:16:03.472
Can you cure any disease?


01:16:03.890 --> 01:16:05.242
Yes.


01:16:05.266 --> 01:16:10.353
For instance... cerebral palsy.


01:16:12.564 --> 01:16:17.610
I couldn't walk... I
didn't feel my legs at all...


01:16:17.986 --> 01:16:20.988
Is that how you buy loyalty?


01:16:21.365 --> 01:16:25.242
I don't buy anything. I help.


01:16:26.203 --> 01:16:30.081
And Zhenya helps me of his own free will.


01:16:30.582 --> 01:16:34.168
That's the advantage we have over slaves.


01:16:48.474 --> 01:16:50.892
I'm glad to see you. But to be honest,


01:16:51.185 --> 01:16:54.396
I'd feel better if you stayed behind.


01:16:55.856 --> 01:16:57.000
Who is that?


01:16:57.024 --> 01:16:59.484
They can help us. It's a long story.


01:17:00.111 --> 01:17:01.986
What do you need to...


01:17:03.155 --> 01:17:05.031
to find who you're looking for?


01:17:05.324 --> 01:17:07.117
We need a quiet place


01:17:07.827 --> 01:17:09.953
where Sasha can concentrate.


01:17:17.335 --> 01:17:18.502
What do you see?


01:17:19.587 --> 01:17:20.879
Nothing.


01:17:21.756 --> 01:17:24.300
The bodies are still there,
no one removed them.


01:17:24.635 --> 01:17:26.302
Perhaps they left?


01:17:26.721 --> 01:17:29.305
That's unlikely. They're regrouping.


01:17:30.141 --> 01:17:31.808
Do we really need to leave?


01:17:33.144 --> 01:17:34.894
We'll die if we stay.


01:17:35.479 --> 01:17:38.523
There, we have a chance.
A small one. But a chance.


01:17:42.652 --> 01:17:43.861
The commander's?


01:17:44.404 --> 01:17:47.740
It was, he won't need it anymore.


01:17:49.284 --> 01:17:50.284
Alright.


01:17:50.410 --> 01:17:52.244
How far to the outpost?


01:17:52.412 --> 01:17:56.540
We won't make it to the outpost.
David. Where did you see the red flares?


01:17:57.000 --> 01:17:59.042
Two there and one there.


01:18:00.795 --> 01:18:03.839
Alright, judging from the location.


01:18:04.466 --> 01:18:07.468
That was either Team 8, 9. Or 10.


01:18:08.470 --> 01:18:10.846
Or Teams 5 and 6 here.


01:18:12.055 --> 01:18:13.973
There were no flares there.


01:18:14.808 --> 01:18:16.601
This is Team 3


01:18:17.603 --> 01:18:19.228
and 4. That way.


01:18:19.897 --> 01:18:21.647
That way is closer.


01:18:21.857 --> 01:18:23.941
No red flares doesn't mean they're alive.


01:18:24.151 --> 01:18:26.068
Maybe, they had no time to launch them.


01:18:26.320 --> 01:18:29.947
Maybe. But we're hoping for the best,
right?


01:18:30.783 --> 01:18:32.366
Men, let's get down.


01:18:32.701 --> 01:18:33.701
Your foot.


01:18:33.869 --> 01:18:35.745
- What's this?
- Life-saving panties.


01:18:36.330 --> 01:18:40.416
Let's say they're alive and out there,
just like us.


01:18:40.626 --> 01:18:42.126
We won't make it there.


01:18:42.336 --> 01:18:45.670
Judging from the map.
We're moving away from the outpost.


01:18:45.922 --> 01:18:49.841
First of all, we outnumber them.
Second, their radio might be working.


01:18:50.176 --> 01:18:54.304
If not, we'll move on to the next team,
then the next one after that.


01:18:55.515 --> 01:18:59.226
The more of us are out there,
the better our chances to survive.


01:18:59.519 --> 01:19:01.728
No, I'm not going there.


01:19:02.188 --> 01:19:03.355
No.


01:19:04.732 --> 01:19:06.733
Calm down. You can do this.


01:19:09.362 --> 01:19:12.489
It's easy. You don't do anything,
I'll lower you down.


01:19:13.198 --> 01:19:15.991
Feet against the wall,
and don't grab the rope.


01:19:16.326 --> 01:19:17.326
Understood?


01:19:17.410 --> 01:19:19.078
- Yes.
- Let's go.


01:19:20.789 --> 01:19:21.914
I can't, I'm scared.


01:19:22.123 --> 01:19:24.375
Calm down. It's alright.


01:19:25.794 --> 01:19:28.462
- No, I can't do this!
- Hey!


01:19:32.926 --> 01:19:34.134
Let's go.


01:19:54.364 --> 01:19:57.658
I'll help you get in the right state.


01:19:58.410 --> 01:20:00.870
Try to remember how your dreams began.


01:20:01.413 --> 01:20:04.039
First, you heard the voices of his slaves.


01:20:04.499 --> 01:20:06.667
Their conversations and orders.


01:20:07.002 --> 01:20:08.377
Try to hear them now.


01:20:10.463 --> 01:20:13.424
You must listen for the one
who controls them.


01:20:14.967 --> 01:20:16.217
Listen.


01:20:17.636 --> 01:20:22.140
Everything depends on you and only you.


01:20:26.186 --> 01:20:28.021
Hear his voice.


01:20:59.218 --> 01:21:00.302
What's that?


01:21:01.638 --> 01:21:04.014
I don't understand. Is that a skyscraper?


01:21:07.310 --> 01:21:08.477
He's there.


01:21:09.103 --> 01:21:10.938
He controls them from there.


01:21:16.068 --> 01:21:17.318
I know where he is.


01:21:17.527 --> 01:21:19.028
He's in Kirov.


01:21:26.328 --> 01:21:27.411
Well done.


01:21:28.038 --> 01:21:30.331
You did everything you had to do.


01:21:35.754 --> 01:21:38.547
We need to mobilize everyone and move out.


01:21:39.591 --> 01:21:41.801
Can anyone tell me
what the hell is going on?


01:21:42.719 --> 01:21:44.553
- It. Colonel!
- It's...


01:21:45.472 --> 01:21:46.972
...hard to explain.


01:21:47.223 --> 01:21:49.808
You were invaded by alien forces.


01:21:50.059 --> 01:21:54.104
About 160 million people have survived
outside the Circle of Life.


01:21:54.355 --> 01:21:58.358
From day one, they've been gathering
toward the Circle,


01:21:58.567 --> 01:22:02.320
collecting weapons. Grouping.
And preparing for war.


01:22:02.947 --> 01:22:04.906
Are you from military intelligence?


01:22:11.789 --> 01:22:13.289
What the hell?


01:22:13.749 --> 01:22:16.752
- How did you...
- I'm what you'd call an "alien."


01:22:18.045 --> 01:22:19.587
But, I'm on your side.


01:22:20.297 --> 01:22:23.299
For now, we still have a chance
to turn things around.


01:22:24.135 --> 01:22:25.468
We must take this chance.


01:22:25.678 --> 01:22:27.887
The enemy is controlled
by someone like him.


01:22:28.139 --> 01:22:31.558
We must take him out
or the Circle of Life won't survive.


01:22:34.103 --> 01:22:36.563
Major, Moscow is under attack.


01:22:40.067 --> 01:22:43.069
The connection is weak,
HQ in Nizhny isn't responding.


01:22:43.362 --> 01:22:45.155
They broke through, sir.


01:22:51.161 --> 01:22:53.162
That means we're almost out of time.


01:22:53.496 --> 01:22:55.414
I'll explain it on the way.


01:23:32.910 --> 01:23:35.078
They're not that scary.


01:23:40.876 --> 01:23:42.418
Please...


01:23:46.215 --> 01:23:48.800
Miss, help us.


01:23:50.093 --> 01:23:53.011
- What?
- We were captured.


01:23:54.847 --> 01:23:58.475
We were here...


01:23:59.393 --> 01:24:01.019
Let me record.


01:24:01.187 --> 01:24:03.814
Miss, please, I'm begging you.


01:24:04.148 --> 01:24:06.274
No!


01:24:06.442 --> 01:24:07.984
- Keep her back.
- No!


01:24:08.194 --> 01:24:10.445
No! Please, no!


01:24:10.696 --> 01:24:13.073
Did you forget the kid who killed the LT?


01:24:13.407 --> 01:24:14.658
Did you forget that?


01:24:16.119 --> 01:24:18.120
They can pretend to be anyone.


01:24:18.871 --> 01:24:20.871
I don't give a shit anymore. Got it?


01:24:21.123 --> 01:24:22.748
Pull yourself together.


01:24:24.376 --> 01:24:26.460
Men, grab the ammo and the food.


01:24:35.095 --> 01:24:36.137
Get down!


01:24:47.150 --> 01:24:48.567
Come on.


01:25:17.554 --> 01:25:18.721
Motherfucker!


01:25:44.872 --> 01:25:46.039
Son of a bitch.


01:25:48.500 --> 01:25:49.542
Let's go.


01:25:57.050 --> 01:25:58.425
Wait.


01:26:02.513 --> 01:26:04.640
I have to tell you something.


01:26:06.351 --> 01:26:07.601
I'll catch up.


01:26:12.899 --> 01:26:14.524
He saw me.


01:26:15.485 --> 01:26:19.613
He looked me in the eye,
and it was beyond terrifying.


01:26:21.241 --> 01:26:23.574
I've never been that terrified in my life.


01:26:24.576 --> 01:26:25.993
Don't be afraid.


01:26:26.245 --> 01:26:28.412
I won't let him get to you.


01:26:29.831 --> 01:26:32.041
But, you'll be better off here. Alright?


01:26:32.501 --> 01:26:34.210
It will be safer this way.


01:26:48.767 --> 01:26:50.977
We'll try to make it in 24 hours.


01:26:52.062 --> 01:26:55.772
I hope this isn't all bullshit,
and we can stop the attack.


01:26:56.148 --> 01:26:57.148
Hang in there.


01:26:57.984 --> 01:27:00.193
We'll be fine, Major. Good luck!


01:28:04.090 --> 01:28:05.257
Are you hurt?


01:28:09.012 --> 01:28:11.638
We need to reach Team 4 somehow.


01:28:13.600 --> 01:28:15.309
Preferably, by car.


01:28:15.894 --> 01:28:18.395
Check the cars,
maybe you'll find one that runs.


01:28:30.282 --> 01:28:31.407
It's running.


01:28:34.203 --> 01:28:36.037
There's still half a tank left.


01:28:39.458 --> 01:28:41.125
Find the first aid kit.


01:28:49.760 --> 01:28:52.136
Is Sasha in the other car?


01:28:54.056 --> 01:28:57.099
Ra saw Sasha and now knows where he is.


01:28:57.934 --> 01:29:00.519
Being near him is an unnecessary risk now.


01:29:01.312 --> 01:29:02.979
Stop the car!


01:29:08.903 --> 01:29:10.112
We're going back! Now!


01:29:10.363 --> 01:29:11.738
What's the problem?


01:29:22.125 --> 01:29:26.585
Outpost is under a guided missile attack!
I repeat, missile attack incoming!


01:30:18.513 --> 01:30:21.932
What the hell? You saw this coming.
They're dead because of you.


01:30:22.809 --> 01:30:24.560
Do you even want to win?


01:30:24.853 --> 01:30:25.978
Not like this.


01:30:26.146 --> 01:30:29.814
If Sasha were with us,
these missiles would hit us.


01:30:30.065 --> 01:30:34.777
Then, mankind wouldn't stand a chance.


01:30:35.029 --> 01:30:37.238
The death of everyone
at the outpost


01:30:37.448 --> 01:30:40.200
was a necessary sacrifice
to save everyone else.


01:31:07.477 --> 01:31:09.102
It's a meat grinder.


01:31:13.566 --> 01:31:14.775
Stay here.


01:31:30.582 --> 01:31:31.916
Yura!


01:31:34.628 --> 01:31:35.795
Oleg.


01:31:38.799 --> 01:31:41.300
How did you know it was me?
Why didn't you shoot?


01:31:41.510 --> 01:31:43.970
I ran out of ammo,
otherwise. I'd shoot you.


01:31:45.180 --> 01:31:48.599
I figured you'd get closer.
And I'd twist your neck.


01:31:50.310 --> 01:31:52.061
I bet I'd twist yours first.


01:31:57.609 --> 01:31:59.110
I'm glad you're alive.


01:32:00.904 --> 01:32:02.572
Just the two of you?


01:32:04.032 --> 01:32:05.074
Yes.


01:32:06.785 --> 01:32:08.661
Not too many here either.


01:32:31.851 --> 01:32:33.602
Are these all the survivors?


01:32:35.354 --> 01:32:36.438
The press?


01:32:36.772 --> 01:32:38.440
Welcome!


01:32:39.066 --> 01:32:42.360
I'd get up. But I'm afraid
my guts would fall out.


01:32:45.406 --> 01:32:46.823
Do you have any ammo left?


01:32:48.409 --> 01:32:50.118
One magazine left.


01:32:50.620 --> 01:32:51.995
Comms?


01:32:52.538 --> 01:32:54.581
Nothing with the outpost or HQ.


01:32:58.002 --> 01:32:59.127
The hell with it.


01:33:22.359 --> 01:33:23.567
They're here.


01:33:23.943 --> 01:33:25.194
Stop!


01:33:25.487 --> 01:33:27.279
Stop all the vehicles.


01:33:36.330 --> 01:33:38.581
I know it was terrifying.


01:33:38.999 --> 01:33:40.583
It will be alright.


01:33:41.752 --> 01:33:43.127
What about the other teams?


01:33:45.923 --> 01:33:48.216
Thanks for picking us up at least.


01:33:48.592 --> 01:33:50.510
We're not taking you.


01:33:50.761 --> 01:33:51.803
What?


01:33:52.971 --> 01:33:54.681
We're going to Kirov.


01:33:55.432 --> 01:33:57.809
We must destroy their command.


01:34:00.604 --> 01:34:03.397
Back to that hellhole?
We just came from there.


01:34:03.648 --> 01:34:07.025
We have civilians - a doctor, a reporter,
some WIAs.


01:34:07.276 --> 01:34:08.462
Are we taking them?


01:34:08.486 --> 01:34:10.445
There's nowhere to go to.


01:34:10.738 --> 01:34:14.491
The outpost is destroyed,
contact with command is lost.


01:34:15.118 --> 01:34:16.910
The Circle of Life is under attack.


01:34:17.245 --> 01:34:20.080
They broke through.
And we're the last hope.


01:34:20.873 --> 01:34:22.791
Actually, he is.


01:34:26.213 --> 01:34:29.048
- Freeze!
- Weapons down! He's on our side.


01:34:38.266 --> 01:34:39.850
Let's move out.


01:35:04.541 --> 01:35:08.896
You're all asleep.


01:35:08.920 --> 01:35:12.483
But you, Yura, woke up.


01:35:12.507 --> 01:35:16.404
It's war. It makes a person
who he's created to be.


01:35:16.428 --> 01:35:19.449
You awoke your true nature.


01:35:19.473 --> 01:35:22.535
That's what makes you stronger
than the others.


01:35:22.559 --> 01:35:25.186
You'll help me kill our mutual enemy.


01:35:28.231 --> 01:35:30.357
We're entering the city.


01:35:43.662 --> 01:35:44.788
Are you OK?


01:35:46.749 --> 01:35:49.083
Do you think they'll take Moscow?


01:35:51.420 --> 01:35:54.297
For all I know, we're all that's left
of mankind.


01:36:19.280 --> 01:36:21.698
Why aren't they attacking us?


01:36:22.033 --> 01:36:24.409
He thinks I died at the outpost.


01:36:24.702 --> 01:36:27.871
Besides, the main force
is in the Circle of Life.


01:36:28.331 --> 01:36:31.166
I'm trying to keep us invisible to them.


01:36:31.584 --> 01:36:34.419
But, the closer we get to Ra,
the weaker I get.


01:36:34.754 --> 01:36:37.713
I'm sure he took measures
to protect himself.


01:36:40.509 --> 01:36:41.551
Major!


01:36:42.052 --> 01:36:44.345
There are armed civilians ahead


01:37:20.090 --> 01:37:21.465
Let's go!


01:38:04.759 --> 01:38:06.801
Heading straight to the skyscraper.


01:39:05.234 --> 01:39:08.653
He will throw everything he has at you.


01:39:09.612 --> 01:39:11.029
I need time.


01:39:11.447 --> 01:39:13.907
I'll take a few soldiers...


01:39:14.242 --> 01:39:15.909
and him.


01:39:31.760 --> 01:39:35.054
Alright, they'll be here soon.
Everyone, get in position!


01:39:39.184 --> 01:39:42.519
Civilians, take cover and stay there.


01:40:05.710 --> 01:40:07.544
Did I miss something?


01:40:09.422 --> 01:40:11.464
He ordered us to guard the entrance.


01:40:11.757 --> 01:40:13.007
We'll fight till the end.


01:40:14.551 --> 01:40:15.676
Alright.


01:40:15.927 --> 01:40:17.720
I'm here if you need me.


01:40:24.644 --> 01:40:27.396
I'll make a bet and assume
it won't be a long battle.


01:40:27.606 --> 01:40:29.356
I'm not much of a gambler.


01:40:38.575 --> 01:40:39.742
Fire!


01:41:03.432 --> 01:41:04.599
Move in!


01:41:22.700 --> 01:41:24.701
RPG on the right!


01:41:30.500 --> 01:41:31.792
Dammit, they're insane!


01:41:32.001 --> 01:41:34.169
I warned you about these freaks.


01:41:34.546 --> 01:41:36.296
Then we're freaks, too.


01:41:38.591 --> 01:41:40.884
Son of a bitch! They're everywhere!


01:41:46.683 --> 01:41:48.058
Please excuse me.


01:41:49.060 --> 01:41:50.686
But it's time for me to go.


01:41:51.980 --> 01:41:53.772
You fart too much in here anyway.


01:42:52.455 --> 01:42:55.332
We need to take a small team
to the neighboring building.


01:42:55.499 --> 01:42:57.334
- We'll take the fire!
- Belay that!


01:42:57.543 --> 01:42:59.628
They asked for time. We gave them time.


01:42:59.837 --> 01:43:01.963
- Let's move out!
- Alright, let's fall back!


01:43:02.215 --> 01:43:04.257
Someone needs to cover us!


01:43:04.508 --> 01:43:07.135
My team and I are staying.
You're in charge.


01:43:07.345 --> 01:43:09.429
- Oleg, go with them!
- But, Major...


01:43:09.597 --> 01:43:11.056
It's an order!


01:43:16.519 --> 01:43:18.706
Let's go upstairs,
we're better off there.


01:43:18.730 --> 01:43:19.772
And the others?


01:43:19.940 --> 01:43:21.732
The others will cover us from here.


01:43:25.445 --> 01:43:28.382
- But we can't...
- We can! Or it's all for nothing.


01:43:28.406 --> 01:43:29.490
Move it!


01:43:35.413 --> 01:43:36.497
Attention, soldiers!


01:43:36.790 --> 01:43:40.793
Let's take as many of these assholes
with us as possible.


01:43:41.670 --> 01:43:44.088
It's been an honor to serve with you, men.


01:43:46.340 --> 01:43:47.840
Yes. Major.


01:44:07.653 --> 01:44:09.153
What the hell?


01:44:58.036 --> 01:45:00.412
Concentrate all fire on that truck!


01:45:18.263 --> 01:45:19.388
This is it.


01:45:46.541 --> 01:45:47.999
Now.


01:47:02.866 --> 01:47:05.701
Are there many like you on the ship?


01:47:06.369 --> 01:47:08.871
Yes. Many. Does that scare you?


01:47:10.123 --> 01:47:11.123
No.


01:47:15.962 --> 01:47:17.129
Don't be afraid.


01:47:17.464 --> 01:47:20.131
Everything is how it's supposed to be.


01:47:20.507 --> 01:47:22.008
What do we do next?


01:47:23.051 --> 01:47:26.846
You'll do what you were created for.
Kill.


01:47:27.389 --> 01:47:29.891
Wars have always made you stronger.


01:47:30.142 --> 01:47:33.644
So much stronger,
that you became a threat to us.


01:47:34.104 --> 01:47:38.232
Ra saw that and made up a religion for you
based on love.


01:47:38.817 --> 01:47:40.943
He hoped the wars would stop


01:47:41.195 --> 01:47:44.489
and that mankind would remain
in a state of infancy.


01:47:44.781 --> 01:47:48.284
With love for those around you
and a total lack of technology.


01:47:48.619 --> 01:47:53.330
But, you turned religion into a reason
for more war and endless conflict.


01:47:53.706 --> 01:47:55.916
You continued to kill each other.


01:47:56.125 --> 01:47:58.210
This is what you're made for.


01:47:58.503 --> 01:48:00.962
The nature of a virus always takes over.


01:48:01.130 --> 01:48:04.758
You don't feel love, compassion, mercy.


01:48:05.301 --> 01:48:07.219
Ra created all that for you.


01:48:07.470 --> 01:48:10.180
When they arrive, you'll kill them all.


01:48:10.515 --> 01:48:11.932
I'll show you how.


01:48:12.475 --> 01:48:14.017
Why now?


01:48:14.435 --> 01:48:15.977
Why didn't you come sooner?


01:48:16.145 --> 01:48:18.605
Before 8 billion people died!


01:48:19.899 --> 01:48:22.066
You could've stopped the radiation!


01:48:23.693 --> 01:48:24.777
I could have.


01:48:25.153 --> 01:48:27.279
But that would disrupt the original plan.


01:48:27.447 --> 01:48:29.907
And the ship would go into
its defensive mode.


01:48:30.116 --> 01:48:33.702
Right now. They don't have a clue,
and we have a chance.


01:48:34.120 --> 01:48:36.455
So for you, this is nothing but numbers?


01:48:36.748 --> 01:48:38.290
Human life is just math?


01:48:38.583 --> 01:48:42.545
You let them kill people for nothing,
just to make your plan work.


01:48:43.672 --> 01:48:46.590
Just like you let everyone die
at the outpost.


01:48:46.925 --> 01:48:50.219
Enough of you have survived,
there's no need for more.


01:48:50.929 --> 01:48:51.970
Really?


01:48:52.263 --> 01:48:54.556
So there's no need for my parents?


01:48:55.391 --> 01:48:56.599
There isn't.


01:48:57.810 --> 01:48:59.394
Don't you get it yet?


01:49:00.729 --> 01:49:04.108
You and your offspring will be
the beginning of a new civilization.


01:49:05.026 --> 01:49:08.654
For centuries, you believed in someone
you'd never seen.


01:49:09.573 --> 01:49:11.865
Now, your god will always be with you.


01:49:12.284 --> 01:49:13.867
But you're not God!


01:49:14.661 --> 01:49:16.036
You're the Devil!


01:49:16.329 --> 01:49:18.414
I was helping you all this time!


01:49:19.666 --> 01:49:22.209
I am the god you deserve.


01:49:24.753 --> 01:49:27.672
Leave us alone.


01:49:28.048 --> 01:49:33.363
Put your gun away. Moron.
We need him alive!


01:49:33.387 --> 01:49:35.532
A million more like him are coming.


01:49:35.556 --> 01:49:39.369
How are you planning to fight them?
With this gun?


01:49:39.393 --> 01:49:43.813
I'd rather take my chances with the gun
than let him mess with my head.


01:49:57.035 --> 01:49:58.285
I'm so sorry.


01:50:15.678 --> 01:50:17.095
I'm sorry!


01:50:23.603 --> 01:50:25.603
That's what I was talking about.


01:50:25.854 --> 01:50:28.648
Even in the weakest of the species,
such as this one,


01:50:28.815 --> 01:50:30.399
the urge to kill is strong.


01:50:34.321 --> 01:50:35.321
Come here!


01:50:35.447 --> 01:50:36.966
- Oleg, no.
- Yura!


01:50:36.990 --> 01:50:39.010
We don't stand a chance without him.


01:50:39.034 --> 01:50:40.534
- Don't you see...
- No!


01:51:32.336 --> 01:51:34.212
Take this, bitch!


01:51:50.187 --> 01:51:52.147
Don't disappoint me.


01:52:05.368 --> 01:52:06.387
Hello, son.


01:52:06.411 --> 01:52:08.431
Do you want to kill me?


01:52:08.455 --> 01:52:09.830
Go ahead.


01:52:10.206 --> 01:52:12.207
You already did it once...


01:52:12.667 --> 01:52:15.043
when you abandoned your mother and me.


01:52:15.837 --> 01:52:18.464
You'll never be as good
as your brother.


01:53:34.287 --> 01:53:36.330
Now we're definitely dead.


01:54:54.575 --> 01:54:55.617
Where are they?


01:54:57.286 --> 01:54:59.329
Why isn't anyone coming out?


01:55:07.837 --> 01:55:09.046
Let's go.


01:55:17.096 --> 01:55:19.139
Come on. Finish me off.


01:55:32.235 --> 01:55:34.862
We're all going to die anyway!


01:57:50.496 --> 01:57:51.913
They're all sleeping.


01:58:16.979 --> 01:58:18.063
This is oxygen.


01:58:18.856 --> 01:58:20.607
It flows through these pipes.


01:58:21.943 --> 01:58:24.152
Soon they will wake up.


01:58:24.529 --> 01:58:26.613
I guess Ra was supposed to wake them.


01:58:28.199 --> 01:58:29.699
What do we do?


01:58:29.992 --> 01:58:31.618
Step back.


01:58:47.218 --> 01:58:48.260
It's a timer.


01:58:49.303 --> 01:58:51.805
We don't have enough time...
or ammo.


01:59:35.973 --> 01:59:38.016
Let's make sure they don't wake up.


02:00:33.029 --> 02:00:35.155
There's gravity everywhere!


02:01:06.561 --> 02:01:07.853
This is the last one!


02:01:11.107 --> 02:01:12.108
Dammit.


02:01:13.568 --> 02:01:14.777
Olya!


02:01:15.821 --> 02:01:17.655
Throw me the ax!


02:02:01.198 --> 02:02:03.450
- What are you waiting for?
- Wait!


02:02:24.637 --> 02:02:26.180
Are these children?

